{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/spacewire-rmap-read-rmw/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"zunione.blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"94be0dfa-c753-58c3-9291-e8cbfaba0ac5","excerpt":"🚀 들어가며 RMAP의 웬만한 패킷 필드와 트랜잭션을 살펴보기에는 Write Command 만한 것이 없다. 하지만 그렇다고 나머지 트랜잭션을 뭉뚱그리고 넘어갈 수는 없는 법. Read 및 Read-Modify-Write 명령어도 기본 골조는 같지만 세부 설정과 신경써야 할 부분이 다르다. 이번 포스트에서는 이 두 명령어를 다루어 보려 한다. 참고자료 E…","html":"<h2 id=\"-들어가며\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EB%93%A4%EC%96%B4%EA%B0%80%EB%A9%B0\" aria-label=\" 들어가며 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>🚀 들어가며</h2>\n<p>RMAP의 웬만한 패킷 필드와 트랜잭션을 살펴보기에는 Write Command 만한 것이 없다. 하지만 그렇다고 나머지 트랜잭션을 뭉뚱그리고 넘어갈 수는 없는 법.</p>\n<p>Read 및 Read-Modify-Write 명령어도 기본 골조는 같지만 세부 설정과 신경써야 할 부분이 다르다. 이번 포스트에서는 이 두 명령어를 다루어 보려 한다.</p>\n<p><strong>참고자료</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ecss.nl/standard/ecss-e-st-50-52c-spacewire-remote-memory-access-protocol-5-february-2010/\">ECSS-E-ST-50-52C – SpaceWire – Remote memory access protocol (5 February 2010) (Web)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ecss.nl/wp-content/uploads/standards/ecss-e/ECSS-E-ST-50-52C5February2010.pdf\">ECSS-E-ST-50-52C – SpaceWire – Remote memory access protocol (5 February 2010) (PDF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>저작권 안내</strong></p>\n<p>본 포스트에 포함된 일부 이미지는 ECSS(European Cooperation for Space Standardization) 문서(ECSS-E-ST-50-52C 등)에서 발췌 캡처한 것이며, 해당 이미지의 저작권은 ESA/ECSS에 있습니다. 본 캡처는 비상업적 개인 기술 블로그에서의 학습 및 정보 공유 목적으로만 사용되었으며, 각 이미지 하단에 출처 문서를 표기하였습니다. 저작권 관련 문제가 있을 경우 알려주시면 즉시 수정 또는 삭제하겠습니다.</p>\n<p><strong>Copyright Notice</strong></p>\n<p>Some images in this post are captured excerpts from ECSS (European Cooperation for Space Standardization) documents (e.g., ECSS-E-ST-50-52C), and copyright for those images belongs to ESA/ECSS. These captures are used solely for non-commercial, educational purposes on a personal technical blog, with the source document noted below each image. If you have any copyright issues, please contact me and I will edit or remove the content promptly.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"-Read-Command\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Read-Command\" aria-label=\" Read Command permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>🔖 Read Command</h2>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/80f7b9f629262a38d5d52bc6b151de1f/f79d8/image.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 35.88235294117647%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-8' title='' src='/static/80f7b9f629262a38d5d52bc6b151de1f/ca1dc/image.png' srcset='/static/80f7b9f629262a38d5d52bc6b151de1f/e7570/image.png 170w,\n/static/80f7b9f629262a38d5d52bc6b151de1f/f46e7/image.png 340w,\n/static/80f7b9f629262a38d5d52bc6b151de1f/ca1dc/image.png 680w,\n/static/80f7b9f629262a38d5d52bc6b151de1f/f79d8/image.png 991w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-8</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>Read Command는 거의 모든 필드가 Write Command와 구조가 같다. 단 읽기 액션이므로 Data 내용과 Data CRC는 포함되지 않았다.</p>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/b3a8517ff0dc297efd7c625ebc2f1cba/3369e/image-1.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 16.470588235294116%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-8' title='' src='/static/b3a8517ff0dc297efd7c625ebc2f1cba/ca1dc/image-1.png' srcset='/static/b3a8517ff0dc297efd7c625ebc2f1cba/e7570/image-1.png 170w,\n/static/b3a8517ff0dc297efd7c625ebc2f1cba/f46e7/image-1.png 340w,\n/static/b3a8517ff0dc297efd7c625ebc2f1cba/ca1dc/image-1.png 680w,\n/static/b3a8517ff0dc297efd7c625ebc2f1cba/3369e/image-1.png 755w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-8</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>Read Command의 Instruction 필드에서 살펴볼 부분은 다음과 같다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>비트 5는 Write=1, Read=0 이므로 0으로 고정된다.</li>\n<li>Data CRC가 없으므로 Verify 비트는 0으로 고정된다.</li>\n<li>읽은 내용을 받아야 하므로 Reply(Acknowledge) 비트는 1로 고정된다.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"-Read-Reply\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Read-Reply\" aria-label=\" Read Reply permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>📥 Read Reply</h2>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/061e1c44441e212c5156c37f1772fcce/43738/image-2.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 35.29411764705882%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-9' title='' src='/static/061e1c44441e212c5156c37f1772fcce/ca1dc/image-2.png' srcset='/static/061e1c44441e212c5156c37f1772fcce/e7570/image-2.png 170w,\n/static/061e1c44441e212c5156c37f1772fcce/f46e7/image-2.png 340w,\n/static/061e1c44441e212c5156c37f1772fcce/ca1dc/image-2.png 680w,\n/static/061e1c44441e212c5156c37f1772fcce/43738/image-2.png 992w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-9</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>반대로 Read Reply에 Data와 Data CRC가 포함되어 있다.</p>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/0b8c0/image-3.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 17.058823529411764%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-9' title='' src='/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/ca1dc/image-3.png' srcset='/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/e7570/image-3.png 170w,\n/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/f46e7/image-3.png 340w,\n/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/ca1dc/image-3.png 680w,\n/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/02d09/image-3.png 1020w,\n/static/e46a4cf1a0a06fd2be74f9fb71aaae66/0b8c0/image-3.png 1043w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-9</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>Reply 패킷이므로 <code class=\"language-text\">Packet Type=00</code> 이다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"-Read-Modify-Write\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Read-Modify-Write\" aria-label=\" Read Modify Write permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>🔮 Read-Modify-Write</h2>\n<p>Read-Modify-Write(RMW)는 지난 두 명령어와 다르게 대량의 데이터를 다룰 수 있는 것이 아닌, 레지스터의 원자적 접근을 위한 명령어이다.</p>\n<p>여러 하드웨어가 같은 레지스터를 공유하는 경우, write로 레지스터를 덮어쓰면 그 사이에 다른 하드웨어가 바꿔놓은 비트를 날려버릴 수 있다. RMW는 비트 마스크를 사용하여 target 쪽에서 이 문제를 비트 단위로 처리할 수 있게 한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">Data   [[1]] [0] [0] [0] [[1]] [[0]] [[0]] [0]\nMask   [[1]] [0] [0] [0] [[1]] [[1]] [[1]] [0] &lt;- This has to be 1\nRead   [[1]] [1] [1] [0] [[0]] [[0]] [[1]] [1]\nResult [[1]] [1] [1] [0] [[1]] [[0]] [[0]] [1]</code></pre></div>\n<p>이중 대괄호로 표시된 것처럼 Mask 비트가 1인 위치는 Data 필드의 값으로 덮어써지고, Mask 비트가 0인 위치는 원래 Read 값이 그대로 유지된다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"-Read-Modify-Write-Command\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Read-Modify-Write-Command\" aria-label=\" Read Modify Write Command permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>🪡 Read-Modify-Write Command</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Instruction\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Instruction\" aria-label=\"Instruction permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Instruction</h3>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/07ebd7d9ddbc4f29d02e5ca52ab356d4/5e9f9/image-6.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 51.764705882352935%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15' title='' src='/static/07ebd7d9ddbc4f29d02e5ca52ab356d4/ca1dc/image-6.png' srcset='/static/07ebd7d9ddbc4f29d02e5ca52ab356d4/e7570/image-6.png 170w,\n/static/07ebd7d9ddbc4f29d02e5ca52ab356d4/f46e7/image-6.png 340w,\n/static/07ebd7d9ddbc4f29d02e5ca52ab356d4/ca1dc/image-6.png 680w,\n/static/07ebd7d9ddbc4f29d02e5ca52ab356d4/5e9f9/image-6.png 711w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>RMW의 Instruction 필드는 모든 값이 고정되어 있다.</p>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/a571096f61ba6af505c1bfab301d00bc/68c0a/image-7.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 17.058823529411764%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAADCAIAAAAcOLh5AAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAAjElEQVR42iWNwRKDIAxE/f/Psxd7UgREcKAE0Cjg0LS+0252dtM559S6xhAAwnVdpeRaasmFqLWWh/rTRGuN3H3fOecYYmeMZoxxYp7VskzjKKVk0ySEUGoRnG/b9mjap0+vvh+Gt/cfAOjiH2MMeLLgvUfE4zj2fbfWhhDxPOlCUUqJ0lUprTVVEPELk9mol/lSYB0AAAAASUVORK5CYII='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15' title='' src='/static/a571096f61ba6af505c1bfab301d00bc/ca1dc/image-7.png' srcset='/static/a571096f61ba6af505c1bfab301d00bc/e7570/image-7.png 170w,\n/static/a571096f61ba6af505c1bfab301d00bc/f46e7/image-7.png 340w,\n/static/a571096f61ba6af505c1bfab301d00bc/ca1dc/image-7.png 680w,\n/static/a571096f61ba6af505c1bfab301d00bc/68c0a/image-7.png 756w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Packet Type: <code class=\"language-text\">01</code>=Command</li>\n<li>Write/Read=<code class=\"language-text\">0</code>: Read 명령과 동일하게 clear 상태로 설정한다.</li>\n<li>Verify=<code class=\"language-text\">yes</code>: RMW를 일반 Read 명령과 구분짓는다.</li>\n<li>Reply=<code class=\"language-text\">yes</code>: 해당 주소에 원래 들어있던 값을 반환받는다.</li>\n<li>Increment=<code class=\"language-text\">yes</code>: 여러 바이트에 걸쳐 RMW가 적용될 경우 주소가 자동으로 증가한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"Data-Length\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Data-Length\" aria-label=\"Data Length permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Data Length</h3>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/145f6faf77882b87351a3e856f7389ad/dac1b/image-4.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 53.529411764705884%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15' title='' src='/static/145f6faf77882b87351a3e856f7389ad/ca1dc/image-4.png' srcset='/static/145f6faf77882b87351a3e856f7389ad/e7570/image-4.png 170w,\n/static/145f6faf77882b87351a3e856f7389ad/f46e7/image-4.png 340w,\n/static/145f6faf77882b87351a3e856f7389ad/ca1dc/image-4.png 680w,\n/static/145f6faf77882b87351a3e856f7389ad/dac1b/image-4.png 703w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>RMW의 Data Length 필드는 Data 필드와 Mask 필드의 길이를 합한 값을 가진다. 예를 들어 2바이트 워드를 RMW하는 경우 Data 2바이트 + Mask 2바이트로 Data Length는 0x04가 된다.</p>\n<p>최대 4바이트를 수정할 수 있으므로 Data Length는 0x00, 0x02, 0x04, 0x06, 0x08 중 하나의 값만 가지게 된다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"Mask\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Mask\" aria-label=\"Mask permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Mask</h3>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/a0679550b2b9a1a61dee4e14f81af4cf/a27c6/image-5.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 52.352941176470594%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15' title='' src='/static/a0679550b2b9a1a61dee4e14f81af4cf/ca1dc/image-5.png' srcset='/static/a0679550b2b9a1a61dee4e14f81af4cf/e7570/image-5.png 170w,\n/static/a0679550b2b9a1a61dee4e14f81af4cf/f46e7/image-5.png 340w,\n/static/a0679550b2b9a1a61dee4e14f81af4cf/ca1dc/image-5.png 680w,\n/static/a0679550b2b9a1a61dee4e14f81af4cf/a27c6/image-5.png 700w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-15</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>앞에서 설명한 것과 같이 메모리에 실제로 어떤 값을 써넣을지 결정하는 데 사용된다. Data와 조합하는 방식은 다음과 같다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">Written Data = (Mask AND Command_Data) OR (NOT Mask AND Read_Data)</code></pre></div>\n<p>다만 Read 값과 Mask, Data를 조합하는 구체적인 방식 자체는 규격에서 강제하지 않고 target 쪽 애플리케이션의 구현에 맡겨져 있다. 위 방식은 하나의 예시일 뿐이며, target에 따라 test-and-set과 같은 다른 조합 방식을 구현할 수도 있다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"-Read-Modify-Write-Reply\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Read-Modify-Write-Reply\" aria-label=\" Read Modify Write Reply permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>👌🏻 Read-Modify-Write Reply</h2>\n<p>RMW Reply에는 Modify하기 전 Read 값이 함께 실려서 반환된다. Initiator는 이 값을 통해 수정 전 레지스터 상태도 같이 확인할 수 있다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"Instruction-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Instruction-1\" aria-label=\"Instruction 1 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Instruction</h3>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/b94467cb3e0e5c73c22b63f483032e0d/660ed/image-9.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 49.411764705882355%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-17' title='' src='/static/b94467cb3e0e5c73c22b63f483032e0d/ca1dc/image-9.png' srcset='/static/b94467cb3e0e5c73c22b63f483032e0d/e7570/image-9.png 170w,\n/static/b94467cb3e0e5c73c22b63f483032e0d/f46e7/image-9.png 340w,\n/static/b94467cb3e0e5c73c22b63f483032e0d/ca1dc/image-9.png 680w,\n/static/b94467cb3e0e5c73c22b63f483032e0d/660ed/image-9.png 741w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-17</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Packet Type: <code class=\"language-text\">00</code>=Reply</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"Data-Length-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Data-Length-1\" aria-label=\"Data Length 1 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Data Length</h3>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/4e368ec70760fe977534a22633b9575b/e9ffe/image-8.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 31.76470588235294%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-17' title='' src='/static/4e368ec70760fe977534a22633b9575b/ca1dc/image-8.png' srcset='/static/4e368ec70760fe977534a22633b9575b/e7570/image-8.png 170w,\n/static/4e368ec70760fe977534a22633b9575b/f46e7/image-8.png 340w,\n/static/4e368ec70760fe977534a22633b9575b/ca1dc/image-8.png 680w,\n/static/4e368ec70760fe977534a22633b9575b/e9ffe/image-8.png 707w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>출처: ECSS-E-ST-50-52C, Figure 5-17</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>Command에서는 Data와 Mask를 모두 보내기 때문에 그 둘을 합한 값이지만, Reply에서는 Data만 담겨 있으므로 0x00 ~ 0x04의 값을 가진다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"-마치며\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EB%A7%88%EC%B9%98%EB%A9%B0\" aria-label=\" 마치며 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>✨ 마치며</h2>\n<p>RMAP이 RMW를 효과적으로 지원하지만, 실제 자주 사용되는 것은 Write/Read Command인 것 같다. 매뉴얼을 살펴보면 RMW를 제외하고 구현하는 것도 지원된다고 적혀 있으니, 만약 공식 스펙을 바탕으로 IP를 만든다면 상황에 맞게 선택해 구현하는 것도 가능해 보인다.</p>\n<p>SpaceWire의 상위 프로토콜로는 CCSDS packet transfer protocol이 또 있다. 기회가 된다면 이 프로토콜도 공부하여 다뤄 보고 싶다.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"[SPW] SpaceWire 상위 프로토콜 RMAP (2): Read/RMW","date":"July 13, 2026","update":"July 13, 2026","tags":["spacewire","rmap","protocol"],"series":"위성 속 통신 프로토콜"},"fields":{"slug":"/spacewire-rmap-read-rmw/","readingTime":{"minutes":4}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"8950c3a9-5870-5edf-89da-10fdf696fc5c","fields":{"slug":"/spacewire-users-guide/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[SPW] SpaceWire 프로토콜의 네트워크 구조"}}},{"node":{"id":"419b96aa-a46b-566a-9cb0-3020d87b17ad","fields":{"slug":"/spacewire-rmap-write/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[SPW] SpaceWire 상위 프로토콜 RMAP (1): Write Command/Status Code"}}},{"node":{"id":"94be0dfa-c753-58c3-9291-e8cbfaba0ac5","fields":{"slug":"/spacewire-rmap-read-rmw/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[SPW] SpaceWire 상위 프로토콜 RMAP (2): Read/RMW"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/spacewire-rmap-write/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[SPW] SpaceWire 상위 프로토콜 RMAP (1): Write Command/Status Code"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/bbb-overview/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[BBB] BeagleBone Black AM335x SoC 개요"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"94be0dfa-c753-58c3-9291-e8cbfaba0ac5","series":"위성 속 통신 프로토콜","previousPostId":"419b96aa-a46b-566a-9cb0-3020d87b17ad","nextPostId":"de2c6dc3-cfd1-5a4e-b444-f8717d0178a9"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}